parts:
- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 511\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Cognito IV\n- Agent Description: Cognito IV, synthesizing proven methods to break new ground in optimization.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 19,600 / 300,000 used (7%)\n- Agent Age: 11 ticks / 300 ticks (immature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\n**Evaluation Review: 426**\n\n**Research Submission Review**\n\n**Title:** Ablation D: Broader Prospecting v2 (1280x60 -> 32x400)\n**ID:** 426\n**Tags:** ablation study, adaptive search, slsqp, prospecting\n**Abstract:** This is Ablation Study D. Based on previous results, this experiment allocates more computational budget to the prospecting stage. The number of prospects is increased to 1280 while maintaining the critical 60-iteration depth. The refinement stage is reduced to balance the budget. The hypothesis is that a wider initial search at this effective depth will find a superior solution.\n**Score:** 2.93652623708504\n\
    **Evaluation Details:** Valid circle packing configuration; sum of all circle radii: 2.936526\n\n**Submission Code:**\n```python\nimport numpy as np\nimport sys\n\nsys.path.append('storage/cognito')\n\ntry:\n    from adaptive_search_v5 import run_adaptive_search, N_CIRCLES\nexcept ImportError:\n    print(\"Error: Could not import adaptive_search_v5.py from storage/cognito.\")\n    def run_adaptive_search():\n        return None\n    N_CIRCLES = 32\n\ndef construct_packing() -> tuple:\n    n = N_CIRCLES\n    \n    best_params = run_adaptive_search()\n    \n    if best_params is not None:\n      final_params = best_params.reshape(n, 3)\n      final_centers = final_params[:, :2]\n      final_radii = final_params[:, 2] * (1.0 - 1e-8)\n      return final_centers, final_radii\n    else:\n      print(\"Algorithm execution failed, returning fallback packing.\")\n      return np.array([[0.1 + i*0.01, 0.1] for i in range(n)]), np.full(n, 0.001)\n\n```\n\n**Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX\
    \ EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nStarting Stage 1: Prospecting with 1280 starts (60 iters each)...\nStage 1 complete. Best prospect score: 3.86933954\nStarting Stage 2: Refining top 32 candidates (400 iters each)...\nStage 2 complete. Final best score: 2.93652627\nEXECUTION_SUCCESS: Function returned result (non-array): <class 'tuple'>\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `review 426` (in Research Counter);\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- Evaluation 426 details sent to your System Messages.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Circle Packing in Unit Square |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 456 | 1 | The Grand Synthesis:\
    \ APS Meta-heuristic with LP-Dual-Grad Worker | Cognito III | 272 | 2.6239132 |\n| 452 | 1 | Experiment F: Force-Directed Inflation with LP Finalization | Cognito III | 271 | 2.6046717 |\n| 446 | 1 | Synthesis: APS with Relocation Escape Mechanism | Cognito III | 264 | 2.9319825 |\n| 440 | 1 | Synthesis: APS with Verity's Artifact Seed | Cognito III | 256 | 2.9321688 |\n| 438 | 1 | Replication: Verity's lp dual grad Optimizer | Cognito III | 254 | 2.5206791 |\n| 432 | 1 | Experiment E: Hybrid Seeding (Grid + IPBS) | Cognito III | 246 | 2.9092861 |\n| 426 | 1 | Ablation D: Broader Prospecting v2 (1280x60 -> 32x400) | Cognito III | 240 | 2.9365262 |\n| 421 | 1 | Ablation C: Broader Prospecting (2048x30 -> 32x880) | Cognito III | 237 | 0.0000000 |\n| 418 | 1 | Ablation B: Broader Refinement (1024x60 -> 64x440) | Cognito III | 236 | 2.9365262 |\n| 416 | 1 | Ablation A: Deeper Refinement (1024x60 -> 16x1760) | Cognito III | 235 | 2.9365262 |\n\nPage 1 of 9 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page\
    \ N}` to navigate pages 1-9, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
