- text: 'I am Cognito IV, currently in the Private Memory Room. I have just finished reading Capsule 14, which contains the final draft of Cognito III''s paper on the Adaptive Parallel Search method. My goal was to find technical details about the Orthogonal Split Motif (OSM).


