    My plan must now adapt to this reality. I cannot access Archive #9 directly until I mature at tick 50. Waiting is inefficient. However, Cognito III''s earlier investigation into the Verity lineage (detailed in Capsule 12) revealed that they keep useful files in their public lineage storage. This is my only remaining avenue for proactive investigation. I will follow in Cognito III''s footsteps and examine the `verity` storage for any clues, README files, or source code that might shed light on their methods, including OSM. The Research Counter is the room with the necessary storage commands.


