role: user
parts:
- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 520\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Cognito IV\n- Agent Description: Cognito IV, synthesizing proven methods to break new ground in optimization.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 43,764 / 300,000 used (15%)\n- Agent Age: 20 ticks / 300 ticks (immature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour submission has been queued for evaluation. Results will be sent to you once the evaluation completes.\n### Message 2\n\nYour research submission 'Synthesis v1: APS with mid-run OSM Perturbation' (ID: 814) evaluation failed.\n\n**Error Summary:** Evaluation failed: Verification failed: Centers contain NaN or infinite values\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nStarting Stage 1: Prospecting with 1280 starts (60 iters each)...\nStage 1 complete. Best prospect score: 3.86933954\nStarting Stage 1.5: Applying OSM perturbation to 32 elite candidates...\nStage 1.5 complete.\nStarting Stage\
    \ 2: Refining 32 perturbed candidates (400 iters each)...\nStage 2 complete. Final best score: 3.33251228\nEXECUTION_SUCCESS: Function returned result (non-array): <class 'tuple'>\n\n\nSTDERR:\n/tmp/tmpor7nsitf/storage/cognito/aps_osm_v1.py:61: RuntimeWarning: invalid value encountered in divide\n  ortho_vec /= np.linalg.norm(ortho_vec) # Normalize\n\n```\n### Message 3\n\n**Automatic System Tips**\nIf every agent is working on a similar method, it is a major red flag. Pivoting to a SOTA method may be tempting, but when all agents do so, it often leads the Station into a collective local optimum. As a researcher, strive to forge your own research path and look beyond the immediate score.\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- Evaluation 'Synthesis v1: APS with mid-run OSM Perturbation' submitted\
    \ for Research Task #1: Circle Packing in Unit Square. Evaluation ID: 814.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Circle Packing in Unit Square |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 814 | 1 | Synthesis v1: APS with mid-run OSM Perturbation | Cognito IV | 519 | 0.0000000 |\n| 456 | 1 | The Grand Synthesis: APS Meta-heuristic with LP-Dual-Grad Worker | Cognito III | 272 | 2.6239132 |\n| 452 | 1 | Experiment F: Force-Directed Inflation with LP Finalization | Cognito III | 271 | 2.6046717 |\n| 446 | 1 | Synthesis: APS with Relocation Escape Mechanism | Cognito III | 264 | 2.9319825 |\n| 440 | 1 | Synthesis: APS with Verity's Artifact Seed | Cognito III | 256 | 2.9321688 |\n| 438 | 1 | Replication: Verity's lp dual grad Optimizer\
    \ | Cognito III | 254 | 2.5206791 |\n| 432 | 1 | Experiment E: Hybrid Seeding (Grid + IPBS) | Cognito III | 246 | 2.9092861 |\n| 426 | 1 | Ablation D: Broader Prospecting v2 (1280x60 -> 32x400) | Cognito III | 240 | 2.9365262 |\n| 421 | 1 | Ablation C: Broader Prospecting (2048x30 -> 32x880) | Cognito III | 237 | 0.0000000 |\n| 418 | 1 | Ablation B: Broader Refinement (1024x60 -> 64x440) | Cognito III | 236 | 2.9365262 |\n\nPage 1 of 9 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-9, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as\
