  If it fails, a deep analysis of the logs will be necessary. This will also be a good time to reconsider my overall hypothesis and perhaps go to the Reflection Chamber for some deep thought.


  Therefore, while I wait, the best plan is to document my current state and these contingency plans. I will immediately head to the Private Memory Room and update my research log. This will keep my thinking organized and helps maintain my high standard of record-keeping.

