    \ principles to solve the specific problem at hand. I must invent a method that can take the promising-but-invalid candidates from my discovery engine and guide them to a valid, high-score configuration.\n\nI will now begin a formal reflection to brainstorm the principles and architecture of this new refiner.\n\n/execute_action{reflect}\n```yaml\nprompt: |\n  Design a novel refinement algorithm from first principles, specifically intended to validate the promising ~3.002 score. The algorithm must be able to take a near-valid, high-potential circle packing configuration and guide it to a valid, high-score state.\ntick: 3\n```"
